{
  "appid": 2208920,
  "name": "刺客信条：英灵殿",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《刺客信条：英灵殿》是一款动作冒险游戏，您将在其中扮演一位从小在征战与荣耀的光辉故事中成长起来的维京战士。在英格兰的黑暗时代背景中探索美丽多变的开放世界。劫掠您的敌人，发展您的居民地，在英灵殿的众神间赢得自己的一席之地。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>版本比较</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/bc3a1cc078ef09b9a1ea152680296b4d.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p></p><br><h1>完全版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/2ae4d897589c66236a14e9a25d7aef50.avif?t=1754572990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras_big/2ae4d897589c66236a14e9a25d7aef50.avif?t=1754572990 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >完全版包含：</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 游戏本体</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 《末日曙光》大型扩展包</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 季票：2 款扩展包（德鲁伊之怒、围攻巴黎）和 1 个任务（贝奥武夫传说）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 狂战士组合包（装备、居民地、长船组合包，以及一组卢恩符文）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这款背景设在英格兰黑暗时代的动作冒险游戏中，化身维京勇士。探索动态开放世界，劫掠敌人，发展你的居民地，在英灵殿的众神间赢得自己的一席之地……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打造属于你的维京传奇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >化身强大的维京劫掠者艾沃尔，率领你的氏族。先进的角色扮演机制，让你影响周遭的世界。随着你的每一个选择，政治联盟、战斗策略、对话选项与装备成长都会发生相应变化，让你铺就只属于自己的荣耀之路！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索黑暗时代的世界</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从挪威的冰封海岸启航，驶向英格兰郁郁葱葱的大地。畅游广袤的开放世界，狩猎传奇野兽，在这个四分五裂的王国揭开隐藏的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验震撼狂暴的战斗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >双持战斧、长剑甚至盾牌，释放维京勇士一往无前的战斗风格，比敌人更加凶狠无情。在贴身近战中活用战术，或粉碎敌人、将其射成蜂窝，或用袖剑一击毙命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >发展你自己的居民地</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造升级各种建筑，包括军营、铁匠铺、纹身铺等，深度定制自己的居民地。为您的氏族召集新成员，打造您专属的维京体验。</p></p><br><h1>诸神黄昏版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/03609847d2e329b74422a251fbec7d9e.avif?t=1754572990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras_big/03609847d2e329b74422a251fbec7d9e.avif?t=1754572990 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>诸神黄昏版包含游戏本体和《末日曙光》扩展包，内容特色包括：<br>- 化身诺斯人的战争与智慧之神——奥丁，驾驭全新神力。<br>- 探索一片新的神话世界<br>- 力战凶猛的冰火劲敌</p><br><h1>豪华版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/f66ed45ce675c847c4c22a3fc7f4a669.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >豪华版包括游戏本体与狂战士组合包：</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 居民地组合包，供你定制英格兰的居民地</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 装备组合包（钩斧、渡鸦皮肤、狼坐骑，以及更多内容）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 长船组合包（一艘气势十足的长船，外加独特的船首像与船帆）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 一组卢恩符文，供你磨砺武器、改良装备</p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >打造属于你的维京传奇</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >化身强大的维京劫掠者艾沃尔，率领你的氏族。先进的角色扮演机制，让你影响周遭的世界。随着你的每一个选择，政治联盟、战斗策略、对话选项与装备成长都会发生相应变化，让你铺就只属于自己的荣耀之路！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/fba1dcd4140fc03cb8a58e3b6359ab9c.poster.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/fba1dcd4140fc03cb8a58e3b6359ab9c.webm?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/fba1dcd4140fc03cb8a58e3b6359ab9c.mp4?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索黑暗时代的世界</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从挪威的冰封海岸启航，驶向英格兰郁郁葱葱的大地。畅游广袤的开放世界，狩猎传奇野兽，在这个四分五裂的王国揭开隐藏的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/654927a538517e539c399f27a1253705.poster.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/654927a538517e539c399f27a1253705.webm?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/654927a538517e539c399f27a1253705.mp4?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >体验震撼狂暴的战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >双持战斧、长剑甚至盾牌，释放维京勇士一往无前的战斗风格，比敌人更加凶狠无情。在贴身近战中活用战术，或粉碎敌人、将其射成蜂窝，或用袖剑一击毙命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/1a08fc562dcbc6732b9e137e3bb32cfe.poster.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/1a08fc562dcbc6732b9e137e3bb32cfe.webm?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/1a08fc562dcbc6732b9e137e3bb32cfe.mp4?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >发展你自己的居民地[</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造升级各种建筑，包括军营、铁匠铺、纹身铺等，深度定制自己的居民地。为您的氏族召集新成员，打造您专属的维京体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/9f5e8c765f4979f4f90f7cdac7824868.poster.avif?t=1754572990\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/9f5e8c765f4979f4f90f7cdac7824868.webm?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208920/extras/9f5e8c765f4979f4f90f7cdac7824868.mp4?t=1754572990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
